<main><section class="page-space"><div class="narrow"><h1 class="section-title">Account types</h1><div class="account-tabs"><article class="account-tab active"><h3>ECN</h3><p>Floating spreads starting from 0 points, adjusted dynamically to market conditions</p></article><article class="account-tab"><h3>STANDARD</h3><p>A trading account designed to deliver stable performance and optimal conditions</p></article><article class="account-tab"><h3>PRO</h3><p>Trade confidently by following the strategies and insights of proven professional traders</p></article></div><section class="account-panel"><dl class="spec-grid"><div class="spec"><dt>Minimum Deposit</dt><dd>$50</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Financial Instruments</dt><dd>Forex, Metals, CFD indices, CFD commodities, CFD stocks</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Margin Call</dt><dd>100%</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Commission (1 lot) *</dt><dd>$4</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Hedged margin</dt><dd>50%</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Deposit Currency</dt><dd>USD</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Stop Out</dt><dd>30%</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Maximum Transaction Amount (Lot)</dt><dd>100</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Max Number of Orders</dt><dd>Not Limited</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Minimum Transaction Amount (Lot)</dt><dd>0.01</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Phone Dealing</dt><dd>Yes</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Type of order execution ****</dt><dd>Market execution</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Max Leverage ***</dt><dd>500</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Requotes (Price Retries)</dt><dd>Not</dd></div><div class="spec"><dt>Swap-free Accounts (Islamic)</dt><dd>On request</dd></div></dl><a class="btn btn-primary mt40" href="#">Top up your account</a></section><div class="account-notes"><p><span class="note-marker">*</span> Commission per side<br><span class="note-marker">**</span> EET - Eastern European Time (GMT +2 in winter, GMT + 3 in summer)<br><span class="note-marker">***</span> Leverage 1:3000 to 